)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "8a83c9ec-7014-483d-9f7b-8823bdf2171e")) (label "FSR_C1" (at 187.96 140.97 90) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "de76ee3f-daba-43d3-ad7e-f87e4182bd7a")) (label "FSR_C1_ADC" (at 187.96 148.59 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "42525393-ba80-4bdc-bb3d-42210aba2c3f")) (label "FSR_C2" (at 198.12 140.97 90) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "22c2fb23-eeef-4523-897e-0b0ac67f7459")) (label "FSR_C2_ADC" (at 198.12 148.59 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "369a677f-c7ed-45e0-b2c8-8cc4d256c142")) (text "FSR series resistors (keep ADC input <= 2.87 V, limit harness fault current)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "15a92700-c2eb-414a-9451-56b625726019")) (text "Notes:\n1. I2C: AS5600 0x36, shin IMU 0x6B (SA0 high), thigh IMU 0x6A on the thigh board. 2.2k pull-ups here only. Start at 100 kHz.\n2. FSR_EN powers all four dividers, high only while sampling. ADC = 3.3 V x 10k / (11.5k + R_fsr), 2.87 V max (0-2.9 V range).\n3. FSRs indicate relative contact only, not calibrated pressure. VBAT_SENSE = VBAT_SW / 2, about 10 uA. Low-battery cutoff 3.5 V.\n4. D7 and D9 spare. DIR tied low; invert in firmware if needed. Thigh IMU INT is not routed; poll it over I2C.\n5. VBAT_SW arrives switched and fused from the thigh board. S3 and S4 are off-board, wired to J2. J1 pinout must match thigh J3.\n6. U2 sits over the axis magnet (6x2.5 mm diametric, in the Inner Hinge snap post): 0.5-3 mm gap, within 0.25 mm of centre.\n7. Firmware must limit BLE TX to 9 dBm or less: 21 dBm peaks at 335 mA, over the thigh board switch rating." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 196.85 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "563b3969-9b23-4136-b6d1-0bdf0769b9b4")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))